Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.27,0:00:10.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, Death Gun was in Laughing\NCoffin, and you guys fought before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.43,0:00:20.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito, I need to know something.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.53,0:00:22.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's about the people you killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.31,0:00:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did you get over what you did?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.55,0:00:26.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you not affected by it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.45,0:00:29.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are you so strong\Nyou're not controlled by it?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.03,0:00:36.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't gotten over it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.89,0:00:42.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Last night, I kept having nightmares\Nabout the three guys I killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.21,0:00:44.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hardly slept at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.75,0:00:48.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I saw their faces right\Nbefore they vanished.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.27,0:00:50.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I heard their voices.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:52.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their words.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.59,0:00:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm ever\Ngoing to forget them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.49,0:00:58.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.99,0:01:01.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.33,0:01:03.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.24,0:01:05.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.71,0:01:06.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.75,0:01:10.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think that's probably how it should be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.57,0:01:11.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.07,0:01:14.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are things I shouldn't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.11,0:01:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What it means to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.89,0:01:17.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The significance of taking life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.07,0:01:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And once I accept it, maybe then\NI'll be able to find some closure.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.21,0:01:24.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's how I see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.29,0:01:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Closure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.33,0:01:28.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you accepting it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.27,0:01:34.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.93,0:01:36.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it.
