Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.51,0:03:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.63,0:03:22.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe that under that cloak
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.97,0:03:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's a real-life person\Nwho just wants to kill.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.27,0:03:27.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.73,0:03:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if I knew his handle in SAO,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.13,0:03:33.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be able to figure out his name\Nand address in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.21,0:03:37.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the reason why I logged into GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.63,0:03:40.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.54,0:03:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then maybe his reason for being\Nhere is because he likes to PK.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.37,0:03:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe he misses the rush of\Ndoing it from SAO. You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.63,0:03:50.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nah, there's more to it than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.69,0:03:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He killed Zexceed and Tarako in\Nfront of a bunch of witnesses.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.31,0:03:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was the same with Pale Rider.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.59,0:04:00.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always picks times when\Nhe's got the biggest audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.97,0:04:03.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that sign of the cross he makes?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.75,0:04:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet he does it to freak out\Nas many people as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:11.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He wants you to believe he's got the\Npower to kill you from in the game,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.27,0:04:12.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but it's all a show.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.85,0:04:15.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's true, then\Nhow's he killing people?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.83,0:04:18.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not because of brain\Ndamage from their headgear.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.85,0:04:22.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The authorities said that Zexeed\Nand Tarako died of heart failure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.75,0:04:24.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heart failure?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.29,0:04:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My god.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.33,0:04:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To be honest, I have no idea\Nhow he killed him either.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.59,0:04:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the thought of firing a gun in the\Nvirtual world and stopping a player's heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.49,0:04:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way that's possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.65,0:04:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.43,0:04:43.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come to think of it. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.87,0:04:46.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was weird. What was?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.53,0:04:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back there in the ruins.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.17,0:04:52.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He had his handgun out for you, but\Nhe switched to the rifle for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.19,0:04:54.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But he kills with the handgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.73,0:04:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have killed me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.95,0:04:58.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So why'd he switch?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.17,0:05:00.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:14.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could it be that he didn't shoot me with\Nit because he couldn't shoot me with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.17,0:05:17.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The handgun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.33,0:05:18.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't use it, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.13,0:05:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The switch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.07,0:05:21.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The crossing-himself thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.17,0:05:24.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Invisibility cloak. Conditions. Rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.41,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phew.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.32,0:05:30.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't tell you how relieved I\Nam to hear you put it into words.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.93,0:05:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Knew it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.84,0:05:34.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In-game guns can't kill IRL.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:39.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shooting someone from in\Nhere is not what does it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.11,0:05:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It takes preparation.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.49,0:05:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you lost me.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.07,0:05:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only way to make it look\Nlike he's killing people in
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.19,0:05:48.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-game is by setting up for the\Nmurder in the real world first.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.35,0:05:51.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How would he set something like that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.63,0:05:56.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, if you're right, he'd have to get\Na player's real-life information to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.99,0:05:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All that stuff's secure, though.
