Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.91,0:06:01.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.82,0:06:05.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone's clever enough, they can\Nfind out a player's address easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.83,0:06:06.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.74,0:06:07.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The terminals.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.21,0:06:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the governor's office.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:13.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to plug your real name\Nand address into him to compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.59,0:06:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's an open space.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:17.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have any privacy there.
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.62,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1182.67,70.67)\blur6\fscx75\fscy75\frz358.6\alpha&HA0&\fax-0.1}Bullet of Bullets\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFinal Entry
Dialogue: 2,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.62,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1182.67,70.67)\blur1.2\fscx75\fscy75\frz358.6\fax-0.1}Bullet of Bullets\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFinal Entry
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.62,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1181.17,69.17)\blur1.2\fscx75\fscy75\frz358.6\c&HB072B5&\fax-0.1}Bullet of Bullets\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFinal Entry
Dialogue: 1,0:06:16.16,0:06:17.62,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(1184.17,72.17)\blur1.2\fscx75\fscy75\frz358.6\c&H467D5F&\fax-0.1}Bullet of Bullets\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hFinal Entry
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.47,0:06:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:22.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saying he peeked over their\Nshoulders while they entered their info?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:25.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That can't be it, because you'd\Nnotice someone lurking next to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.07,0:06:29.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He could have used a scope or some\Nbinoculars from across the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.61,0:06:30.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's breaking etiquette.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:33.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd get his ass kicked\Nout of the game for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.27,0:06:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, how about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.09,0:06:42.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe Death Gun can, like, use his\Ncloak to turn invisible in town, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.83,0:06:46.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd be right there, and\Nyou wouldn't even know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.01,0:06:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But still, he can't do\Nanything in the real world.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.15,0:06:52.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he's logged in here,\Nhe's unconscious there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.71,0:06:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.51,0:07:02.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! That's it? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.65,0:07:04.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just him!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.69,0:07:06.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun has a partner!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.31,0:07:09.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Check it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.59,0:07:12.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of them plays as the Death Gun avatar.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.67,0:07:14.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His job is to shoot the target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.49,0:07:18.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At the same time in the real world, the\Nsecond person's in the target's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.97,0:07:20.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His job is to take the player out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.69,0:07:27.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but let's say they\Nfound out your address.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.73,0:07:29.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the other people living there?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.91,0:07:31.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And they'd need a key.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.43,0:07:33.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As far as Zexeed and Tarako go,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.01,0:07:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they lived alone and their\Napartments were in older
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.73,0:07:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,buildings the e-locks on their\Ndoors were probably first gen
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.95,0:07:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,not very secure besides they\Nwere both diving in ggo during
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.99,0:07:48.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the break-in so they were both\Nunconscious and completely
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.75,0:07:51.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,helpless they couldn't hear\Nso the killer could take his
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.01,0:07:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time getting in but then you\Nsaid the cause of death for both
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.83,0:07:59.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was heart failure right so\Nhow'd they stop someone's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.03,0:08:02.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in a way both the cops and the\Ncoroner couldn't figure out?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.87,0:08:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe by injecting some\Nkind of drug or something?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.37,0:08:07.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's one way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.63,0:08:10.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but someone should\Nhave found evidence of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.91,0:08:12.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A mark or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They didn't find the bodies for a\Nwhile, so they were pretty decomposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.37,0:08:21.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Besides, a hardcore gamer can go\Nfor days without eating or sleeping.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.43,0:08:26.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I doubt anyone would think it's weird if\Nsomeone died of a heart attack after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.99,0:08:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right. I mean, why else would anyone do?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.83,0:08:37.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this maybe or maybe they do it because red
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.49,0:08:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,players are who they\Nreally are I mean deep
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.65,0:08:44.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,down I think I'm really a swordsman when
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.73,0:08:49.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you put it that way I can sort of understand\Nthere's times when I think I'm a real
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.99,0:08:55.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sniper not a gamer wait Do you think the
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guy doing the killings a red player too?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.09,0:08:59.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like Death Gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.29,0:09:03.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, they were probably in\NLaughing Coffin together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.31,0:09:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm still wondering how\Nthey coordinated the
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.67,0:09:09.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,killings between this\Nworld and the real one.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.33,0:09:11.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How were they so precise about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.07,0:09:14.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.59,0:09:17.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what doing the Sign\Nof the Cross is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.37,0:09:18.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not just for show.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.99,0:09:22.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's also a great opportunity\Nto sneak a peek at his watch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.09,0:09:25.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.09,0:09:32.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Xenon, do you live alone?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.23,0:09:36.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, yeah, but I'm sure I locked my door.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:42.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My building's got first-gen\Nlocks, but I've also got a chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.03,0:09:46.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I left the chain off tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.15,0:09:47.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.71,0:09:53.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, you're not gonna like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.17,0:09:58.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When death gun was\Nchasing us on that horse
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:01.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,i wasn't the one he was\Nshooting at and that
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.89,0:10:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Could only mean they got their next victim
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.71,0:10:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,all set up and ready to\Ngo okay then who's next
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.55,0:10:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got a feeling that right now in the real\Nworld death gun's partner's in your place
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.29,0:10:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's watching the live stream, waiting for
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.11,0:10:21.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when you get shot by that\Ngun it's just a hunch
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.97,0:10:24.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.09,0:11:02.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.29,0:11:04.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that. Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.03,0:11:20.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.35,0:11:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you log out now, you'll be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:25.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.61,0:11:26.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.07,0:11:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Until Death Gun shoots you, the guy in your\Nplace isn't going to do anything, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.45,0:11:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the rule they set for themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.25,0:11:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if you log out now and wake up\Nwith his partner there, he'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.63,0:11:52.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you have to calm down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.69,0:11:55.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.97,0:11:57.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so scared.
