Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.55,0:12:09.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Jeez, Chris Head.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.15,0:12:11.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Took you long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.69,0:12:13.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.93,0:12:17.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I booked it over here as fast\Nas I could for my save point.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.45,0:12:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If there were a speed limit in ALO, my\Nlicense would have gotten suspended.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.21,0:12:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.37,0:12:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.65,0:12:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'd be happy to explain in detail, but I\Nshould warn you, it might take a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.63,0:12:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To tell the truth, I'm not\N100 % sure where to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.67,0:12:41.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, don't even.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.01,0:12:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not to worry, I know just where to start.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.47,0:12:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On November 9th, in Gun Gale Online,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.35,0:12:53.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a player called Death Gun fired his weapon\Nat an avatar appearing on a monitor.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.19,0:12:58.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That same day in Nakano Ward, the\Nplayer of that avatar mysteriously died.
