Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.55,0:13:05.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Young lady, that was unbelievable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.81,0:13:09.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gathering all that information\Nand connecting it so quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.63,0:13:11.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you must be quite the researcher.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:14.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you ever thought about\Na career in the VR section?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.65,0:13:16.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, you win. I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.91,0:13:19.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not going to stonewall you, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.21,0:13:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just complimenting her is all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.83,0:13:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's right, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.93,0:13:23.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.23,0:13:25.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yo, Chris Heider, whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.03,0:13:29.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you're the one that hired\NKirito to dive into that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.45,0:13:30.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So let me get this straight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.85,0:13:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got him to convert\Nover knowing a player
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.89,0:13:37.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,got shot in-game and died IRL because\Nof it? Easy, Klein. I can explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.53,0:13:40.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not how the player died. Then how?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.65,0:13:42.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not the Amusphere rig.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.83,0:13:45.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter what happens to you\Nin-game, it can't hurt you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.03,0:13:48.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it certainly can't\Nstop a player's heart
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.29,0:13:50.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,when it's not even\Ndirectly connected to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:51.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As a matter of fact,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.53,0:13:53.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kirito and I met last week to talk about
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.61,0:13:56.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it and pretty much\Nagreed it was impossible.
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.92,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(143.08,410.77)\blur1.2\shad0.75\fscx35\fscy35\frz354.5\c&HB0A7A9&\4c&HA587A4&\fax-0.05}Yamikaze
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.92,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(134,526)\blur1.2\shad0.75\fscx35\fscy35\frz354.5\c&HB0A7A9&\4c&HA587A4&\4a&H30&\fax-0.05}Xiahou Dun
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.92,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(139.39,564.92)\blur1.2\shad0.75\fscx35\fscy35\frz354.5\c&HB0A7A9&\4c&HA587A4&\4a&H30&\fax-0.05}Lion King Richie
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.92,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(90.95,791.59)\blur1.2\shad0.75\fscx35\fscy35\frz354.5\c&H9B8F8B&\4c&HA587A4&\4a&H60&\fax-0.05}Shishigane
Dialogue: 1,0:13:55.95,0:14:00.92,Android,,0,0,0,,{\pos(64.8,906)\blur1.2\shad0.75\fscx35\fscy35\frz354.5\c&H9B8F8B&\4c&HA587A4&\4a&H60&\fax-0.05}Fernay
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.27,0:14:01.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone can kill a person\Nin real life by shooting them in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.49,0:14:05.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay then, if what you say is true,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.89,0:14:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how come you had my brother\Ndive into GGO for you, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.63,0:14:11.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You had a hunch something was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.11,0:14:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scratch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.03,0:14:14.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:16.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That Death Gun guy's a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.79,0:14:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I bet you sent my brother\Nin to try to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.11,0:14:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chris Height, we figured it out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.27,0:14:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Death Gun is an SAO survivor just like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.29,0:14:28.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But unlike us,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.61,0:14:32.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,he was a red player who was in a guild\Nof killers called Laughing Coffin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.83,0:14:34.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You sure he was with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.29,0:14:36.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.20,0:14:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of us can remember his name, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.33,0:14:41.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Klein and I met him once, when\Nour group went to capture his.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.73,0:14:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, hey Asuna, I get the feeling Chris\NHeight knows more than he's letting on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.83,0:14:49.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No offense Chris height\Nbut all we know is you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.65,0:14:51.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,work for the government\Ndoing something with
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.35,0:14:54.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,networks and that you\Nplay a lo as part of some
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.71,0:14:58.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kind of research you're\Ndoing on VR Miss only for the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.73,0:15:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,past year the job I\Nhad before was a little
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.17,0:15:06.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,different I used to be part\Nof the task force for the
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.49,0:15:10.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,SAO incident but even\Nthough we were called a
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.61,0:15:13.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,task force in the end we\Nwere pretty ineffective.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.45,0:15:18.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chris Height, you're obviously\Nwell-connected, and with a little digging,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.67,0:15:22.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you could find out what the real-life\Nname and address of this death gun is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.61,0:15:26.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just make a list of the handles of all\Nthe surviving Laughing Coffin members,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.63,0:15:28.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,then contact their ISPs,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.61,0:15:32.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask which one's playing GGO\Nnow, and trace their location.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.25,0:15:34.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, sorry, that's not possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.31,0:15:36.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ISPs aren't going to\Ngive out a player's real
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.73,0:15:39.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,-life info if all we have\Nto go on are their handles.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.85,0:15:42.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Maybe if we ask the game's\Nadmins, they could help.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.53,0:15:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They might, but GGO's\Nadmins are in the U.S.,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.37,0:15:47.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it'll be a while\Nbefore we got an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.45,0:15:54.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know my brother, and right now\Nhe's risking his life in that game,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.45,0:15:56.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trying to find out who this person is.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.81,0:16:01.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he came home last night, he had this\Nlook on his face, like he'd seen a ghost.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.01,0:16:05.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must have bumped into the guy\Nyesterday during the prelims.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.91,0:16:10.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that's when he realized someone\Nfrom Laughing Coffin was in GGO.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.39,0:16:14.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone who figured out how to\Nkill players for real again.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.51,0:16:18.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brother went back to put\Nan end to that nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.95,0:16:22.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To find out his name and stop\Nhis PK-ing once and for all.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.79,0:16:24.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Darn it, Kirito!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:26.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You should have said something?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.51,0:16:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.42,0:16:30.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you always do this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.95,0:16:34.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That damn idiot Why\Ndidn't he say anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.57,0:16:36.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could be backing him up right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.45,0:16:39.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All he had to do was ask and I\Nwould have converted over too!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.77,0:16:40.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We all would have.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.01,0:16:41.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you see?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.01,0:16:43.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why he didn't tell us.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.63,0:16:46.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If he thought there was any real\Ndanger in what he was doing,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.83,0:16:49.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's no way he'd get\Nus mixed up in it, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.45,0:16:50.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's just how he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.43,0:16:52.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.63,0:16:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He always thinks of others before himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.25,0:16:57.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, he's probably\Nprotecting someone right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.85,0:17:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And whoever that is, I bet it's\Nsomeone who doesn't like him much.
