Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.41,0:17:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, Chrysheight. Where\Nis Kirito diving from?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.47,0:17:12.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know you know, so\Nyou better tell me now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.75,0:17:14.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's confidential.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.89,0:17:17.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.80,0:17:18.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll tell you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.93,0:17:21.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I set up the room myself, so he's safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.49,0:17:22.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Security's rock solid.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.89,0:17:24.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And the monitoring's top of the line.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.55,0:17:27.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got a trained professional\Nright by his side at all times.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.91,0:17:30.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I guarantee that his\Nbody's in no danger whatsoever.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.69,0:17:31.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.01,0:17:33.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.97,0:17:37.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's in Ocha no Miss, in\NChiyoda ward. He's in Chiyoda?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.15,0:17:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is that the same hospital he\Nwas in during his rehabilitation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.55,0:17:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, that's the one.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.49,0:17:44.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.77,0:17:47.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to see him, and you\Ncan't do a thing about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.55,0:17:55.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me you got a plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.33,0:17:59.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're going to take out Death Gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.71,0:18:03.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once we do, his real-world\Npartner will stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.53,0:18:05.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he'll just leave your apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.89,0:18:07.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but he's skilled.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.15,0:18:09.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Black star or no black star.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.91,0:18:14.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You saw he dodged Hecate's\Nbullet from just 100 meters away.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.91,0:18:19.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And besides, I can't hide in\Nthis cave forever, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.27,0:18:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,By now, the other players probably\Nfigured out the two of us are in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.25,0:18:26.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might as well be sitting ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.63,0:18:29.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a matter of time before\Nsomeone tosses a grenade in.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.01,0:18:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.23,0:18:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been a team this\Nwhole time anyway, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.47,0:18:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might as well finish it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.97,0:18:40.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, but there's still the risk\Nhe shoots you with that gun.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.03,0:18:41.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.23,0:18:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just an old-school\Nsingle-action sidearm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.05,0:18:48.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He can fire it all he\Nwants, but I got you there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.47,0:18:50.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just deflect the bullets with your sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.59,0:18:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, and I won't let a\Nsingle one of them hit you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.83,0:18:56.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I still don't feel good about\Nyou being out there, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.93,0:19:00.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, Death Gun's dangerous, and\Nyou shouldn't get too close to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.41,0:19:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.53,0:19:06.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm totally cool with you fighting with\Nme, and I wouldn't have it any other way.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.63,0:19:09.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But Sinon, you're a sniper, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.49,0:19:11.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't your specialty\Nthe long-range attack?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.01,0:19:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah. What about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.39,0:19:15.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.51,0:19:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the next scan, I'm going to\Nstep outside so it picks me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.89,0:19:21.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That way, we'll get\NDeath Gun to come to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.69,0:19:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'll probably keep his\Ndistance and take cover.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.97,0:19:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then he'll try to pick\Nme off with his rifle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.67,0:19:30.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When he shoots, we'll know where\Nhe is, and then you take him out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:31.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.43,0:19:34.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you cool with playing\Nthe decoy? Mm-hmm.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.39,0:19:37.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we do it your way then.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.87,0:19:39.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just be careful out there,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.35,0:19:43.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,because if he drops you with his\Nfirst shot, I'm going to be pissed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.73,0:19:45.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll keep that in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, I just remembered.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.15,0:19:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,His rifle's got a silencer, and you won't\Nsee the bullet line on the first shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.29,0:19:53.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'll just predict the prediction.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.53,0:19:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, like a certain\Nno-good faker told...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.19,0:19:59.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I think we should stop talking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.63,0:20:05.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.61,0:20:07.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We should have been paying more attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.93,0:20:08.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.03,0:20:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And will it kill us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.91,0:20:12.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a live stream camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.09,0:20:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usually, they're only supposed to\Nshadow players on the battlefield.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.99,0:20:16.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,field.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.90,0:20:20.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess this one's in here now, because\Nthere aren't many of us left out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.45,0:20:23.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then, do you think it hurt us?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.63,0:20:24.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.95,0:20:28.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,For it to pick us up, we'd have to\Nbe shouting at the top of our lungs.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.43,0:20:29.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wave to the audience.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.59,0:20:32.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Unless, you got someone back at home.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.85,0:20:34.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't want seeing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.67,0:20:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.69,0:20:40.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't you be worried who's watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.67,0:20:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, since I sort of look like\Na girl, they might, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.95,0:20:45.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,think you're, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.41,0:20:47.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I don't care.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.33,0:20:48.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can think what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.81,0:20:50.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The guys in this game are dorks.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.43,0:20:54.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they think I'm gay, at least they'll\Nstop hitting on me every five seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.31,0:20:57.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How much longer am I going to have\Nto keep pretending to be a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:58.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you poor baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.21,0:21:01.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've been faking it like\Na champ since you logged in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.57,0:21:03.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Another hour or two won't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.21,0:21:05.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.87,0:21:09.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We better get ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.27,0:21:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We got two minutes\Nbefore the next SAT scan.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.39,0:21:14.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll set up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.57,0:21:19.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you get outside, fire up your terminal\Nand let me know when our boy's close.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.99,0:21:24.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait. Hold on.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.07,0:21:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why? What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.77,0:21:28.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too late to change the plan now.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.45,0:21:30.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.36,0:21:31.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to change anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.03,0:21:33.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's something else.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.59,0:21:36.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I was just thinking about\NDeath Gun's real handle here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.91,0:21:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only name you didn't recognize\Nwho's still alive is Sterben.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.31,0:21:41.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh. Huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.69,0:21:43.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I guess that's him, then.
