Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.69,0:22:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been in a
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.71,0:22:22.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,long
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I've turned my back so many times
Dialogue: 1,0:22:24.42,0:22:27.97,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k28}Ka{\k45}wa{\k22}ru {\k46}ko{\k44}to {\k42}nai {\k24}ka{\k23}ko {\k81}ni
