Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.93,0:22:29.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never been in a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}On the past that will never change
Dialogue: 1,0:22:27.97,0:22:31.60,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k33}Na{\k45}n{\k22}do {\k38}mo {\k51}se {\k42}wo {\k23}mu{\k21}ke{\k47}te{\k41}ta
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.79,0:22:33.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen any of my pain.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:31.60,0:22:38.98,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}While hiding the scars I can never show anyone
