Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.39,0:22:36.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've been hiding a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.03,0:22:41.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've always been hiding a long time.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:38.98,0:22:46.11,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I will embrace all this pain that has started flooding through me
