Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-English,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)}I don't need warmth at all
Dialogue: 1,0:22:46.11,0:22:49.07,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k32}It{\k22}su{\k21}ka {\k24}ki{\k23}e{\k21}ru {\k22}nu{\k23}ku{\k26}mo{\k20}ri {\k22}na{\k40}ra
