Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.05,0:23:15.81,ED-Rom,,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,200)\k53}Ko{\k45}ko{\k44}ro {\k45}fu{\k22}ka{\k86}ku {\k30}shi{\k43}zu{\k22}me{\k89}ta {\k21}yo{\k44}wa{\k24}ku{\k44}te {\k46}mo{\k44}roi {\k25}ji{\k49}bun
